    "problem_statement": "Title rendering issue with tables using DOUBLE_BORDER style\n\nDescription\n\nThere seems to be an issue with rendering table titles when using the DOUBLE_BORDER style. When setting a title for a table with this style, the title does not appear centered as expected. Instead, it seems to be misaligned, which affects the overall appearance of the table.\n\nTo reproduce this issue, you can use the following setup:\n\n```python\nfrom prettytable import PrettyTable, TableStyle, HRuleStyle\n\ntable = PrettyTable()\ntable.set_style(TableStyle.DOUBLE_BORDER)\ntable.title = 'Title'\ntable.hrules = HRuleStyle.ALL\ntable.add_row(['Adelaide', 1295, 1158259, 600.5])\ntable.add_row(['Brisbane', 5905, 1857594, 1146.4])\ntable.add_row(['Darwin', 112, 120900, 1714.7])\ntable.add_row(['Hobart', 1357, 205556, 619.5])\ntable.add_row(['Sydney', 2058, 4336374, 1214.8])\ntable.add_row(['Melbourne', 1566, 3806092, 646.9])\ntable.add_row(['Perth', 5386, 1554769, 869.4])\n\nprint(table)\n```\n\nExpected output:\n```\n╔═════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                      Title                      ║\n╠═══════════╦══════╦════════════╦═════════════════╣\n║ City name ║ Area ║ Population ║ Annual Rainfall ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║  Adelaide ║ 1295 ║  1158259   ║      600.5      ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║  Brisbane ║ 5905 ║  1857594   ║      1146.4     ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║   Darwin  ║ 112  ║   120900   ║      1714.7     ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║   Hobart  ║ 1357 ║   205556   ║      619.5      ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║   Sydney  ║ 2058 ║  4336374   ║      1214.8     ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║ Melbourne ║ 1566 ║  3806092   ║      646.9      ║\n╠═══════════╬══════╬════════════╬═════════════════╣\n║   Perth   ║ 5386 ║  1554769   ║      869.4      ║\n╚═══════════╩══════╩════════════╩═════════════════╝\n```\n\nActual output:\nThe title is not centered properly within the table width, leading to a misaligned appearance. This issue is particularly noticeable when the table has a border and uses the DOUBLE_BORDER style."
  },
